.git
.venv
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
catboost_info
.env
.pytest_cache
*.md

# Eksperimen survival - artifact-nya bisa berukuran GB (RandomSurvivalForest
# menyimpan kurva per leaf node) dan reports/eksperimen tidak dibutuhkan
# runtime. Tanpa baris ini, `COPY . .` di Dockerfile menyeret ~5,8 GB
# artifact eksperimen ke setiap image production (lihat reports/gate_decision.md
# fase restrukturisasi survival - Fase 0.1).
#
# KECUALI 3 file compact di bawah - predict/survival.py (field advisory
# median_days_to_failure/survival_curve, mode aditif) MEMBACA-nya di
# runtime dari survival_model/event_based/artifacts/. Tanpa pengecualian
# ini field advisory diam-diam selalu None di production (FileNotFoundError
# tertangkap dan disembunyikan sengaja - lihat serving/predictor.py
# _survival_advisory_fields) walau seluruh test lokal lulus, karena test
# jalan di luar container tanpa .dockerignore. y_train.joblib dan
# _experiment_cache/ TIDAK disertakan - keduanya cuma dipakai training/
# evaluasi, bukan predict_survival.load_model().
survival_model/*
!survival_model/event_based
survival_model/event_based/*
!survival_model/event_based/artifacts
survival_model/event_based/artifacts/*
!survival_model/event_based/artifacts/models.joblib
!survival_model/event_based/artifacts/encoder.joblib
!survival_model/event_based/artifacts/metadata.json
reports/
tests/
.cache/
models/*/*/eval/
